# save writes the player file (compared whole: the clock is fixed, so LogO and Plyd are too), lags 48 pulses,
# and quit saves again and closes the connection.
@connect rambler
Rambler
psswrd
@return
title the Saver
prompt <%W>
save
@file ../player/Rambler
look
@pulse 47
@pulse 1
s
quit
@pulse 8
@file ../player/Rambler
@state
